package.descr:
Adds VPN &gt; WireGuard Easy, a single Easy Peers tab.&lt;br /&gt;
				Creates a client key pair with wg(8), saves the resulting peer&lt;br /&gt;
				through the native pfSense-pkg-WireGuard API, and returns a ready&lt;br /&gt;
				to use client .conf file with a QR code and email delivery.&lt;br /&gt;
				Requires pfSense-pkg-WireGuard. No native file is modified.
